#: MainWindow.cpp:53
msgctxt "@action Verb, to clear a text area"
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Očisti"

#: TutorialClearText.cpp:39 TutorialClearText.js:21 TutorialClearText.py:24
msgctxt "@info/plain"
msgid "Clear the text area"
msgstr "Isprazni tekstualno polje"

#: TutorialClearText.cpp:40 TutorialClearText.js:24 TutorialClearText.py:27
msgctxt "@info/plain"
msgid "This tutorial shows how to clean the text area with ease"
msgstr "Ova lekcija pokazuje kako isprazniti tekstualno polje s lakoćom"

#: TutorialClearText.cpp:45 TutorialClearText.cpp:75 TutorialClearText.js:28
#: TutorialClearText.js:37 TutorialClearText.py:31 TutorialClearText.py:40
#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:85 TutorialMoveText.cpp:177 TutorialMoveText.py:86
#: TutorialMoveText.py:93
msgctxt "@item:intext"
msgid "Hello world"
msgstr "Zdravo, svijete"

#: TutorialClearText.cpp:45 TutorialClearText.js:28 TutorialClearText.py:31
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"In this tutorial you will learn how to clear text in the test application."
"<nl/>First, write \"%1\" (without quotes) in the text area"
msgstr ""
"U ovoj lekciji ćete naučiti kako isprazniti tekstualno polje u testnoj "
"aplikaciji.<nl/>Prvo napišite \"%1\" (bez navodnika) u tekstualno polje"

#: TutorialClearText.cpp:55 TutorialClearText.js:46 TutorialClearText.py:47
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Now, you must trigger the clear action.<nl/>To do this, you can click in "
"<interface>File|Clear</interface>, or in the toolbar button called "
"<interface>Clear</interface>"
msgstr ""
"Sada, morate pokrenuti akciju pražnjenja.<nl/>Da biste to uradili, možete "
"kliknuti na <interface>File|Clear</interface>, ili na dugme iz traka s "
"alatima pod nazivom <interface>Clear</interface>"

#: TutorialClearText.cpp:65 TutorialClearText.js:58 TutorialClearText.py:59
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "And that's all.<nl/>Now you can close the tutorial."
msgstr "I to je sve.<nl/>Sada možete zatvoriti lekciju."

#: TutorialClearText.js:22
msgctxt "@item:intext Programming language"
msgid "JavaScript"
msgstr "JavaScript"

#: TutorialClearText.js:23 TutorialClearText.py:26 TutorialMoveText.py:26
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info/plain Tutorial name (Programming language name)"
msgid "%1 (%2)"
msgstr "%1 (%2)"

#: TutorialClearText.py:25 TutorialMoveText.py:25
msgctxt "@item:intext Programming language"
msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:66 TutorialMoveText.py:24
msgctxt "@info/plain"
msgid "Move text in the text area"
msgstr "Pomjeri tekst u tekstualno polje"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:67 TutorialMoveText.py:27
msgctxt "@info/plain"
msgid "This tutorial shows how to move text in the text area"
msgstr "Ova lekcija pokazuje kako možete pomjeriti tekst u tekstualno polje"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:76 TutorialMoveText.py:68
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"In this tutorial you will learn how to move text in the test application.<nl/"
">Text can be moved using the mouse or the keyboard. What do you prefer?"
msgstr ""
"U ovoj lekciji ćete naučiti kako pomjeriti tekst u testnoj aplikaciji.<nl/"
">Ta radnja može biti učinjena preko miša ili tastature. Šta vi preferirate?"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:78 TutorialMoveText.py:70
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "Miš"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:79 TutorialMoveText.py:76
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "Keyboard"
msgstr "Tastatura"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:85 TutorialMoveText.py:86
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "First of all, clean the text area and write \"%1\" (without quotes)"
msgstr "Prvo, ispraznite tekstualno polje i napišite \"%1\" (bez navodnika)"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:94 TutorialMoveText.cpp:184 TutorialMoveText.py:100
#: TutorialMoveText.py:107
msgctxt "@item:intext As in 'Hello world'"
msgid "world"
msgstr "svijet"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:94 TutorialMoveText.py:100
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Now, select the text \"%1\" in the text area"
msgstr "Sada izaberite tekst \"%1\" u tekstualnom polju"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:103 TutorialMoveText.py:117
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The next thing to do is cut the selected text. Cutting it will remove it "
"from the text area, but in some Steps we will make it appear again. To cut "
"the selected text, click in <interface>Edit|Cut</interface> or in the button "
"of the toolbar"
msgstr ""
"Zatim, izrežite izabrani tekst. Ta radnja će ga izbrisati iz tekstualnog "
"polja, ali u narednim koracima će ga ponovo prikazati. Da biste izrezali "
"odabrani tekst, kliknite na <interface>Edit|Cut</interface> ili na dugme iz "
"trake s alatima"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:113 TutorialMoveText.py:128
msgctxt "@item:intext As in 'Hello world'"
msgid "Hello"
msgstr "Zdravo"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:113 TutorialMoveText.py:128
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Move the cursor to the beginning of the document, before \"%1\" text"
msgstr "Pomjerite pokazivač na početak dokumenta, prije \"%1\" teksta"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:122 TutorialMoveText.py:142
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Finally, paste the text you have cut previously. To do this, click in "
"<interface>Edit|Paste</interface> or in the button in the toolbar"
msgstr ""
"Konačno, zalijepite tekst koji ste ranije izrezali. Da biste ovo uradili, "
"kliknite na <interface>Edit|Paste</interface> ili na dugme iz trake s alatima"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:132
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Press with the left button of the mouse on the selected text. You must press "
"on it, or the selection will change, and you will have to select it again. "
"Do not release the button yet."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite lijevim klikom miša odabrani tekst. Morate to uraditi, ili će se "
"izgubiti izbor teksta, i morat ćete ponovo to uraditi. Ne opuštajte dugme "
"lijevog klika još uvijek."

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:141 TutorialMoveText.py:171
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Without releasing the mouse button, move the cursor to the desired position, "
"for example the beginning of the text.<nl/>Once the cursor is there, you can "
"release the mouse button, and the text will be moved."
msgstr ""
"Bez opuštanja dugmeta miša, pomjerite pokazivač na željenu poziciju, "
"naprimjer na početak teksta.<nl/>Jednom kada se pokazivač nađe na tom "
"mjestu, možete opustiti dugme i sada će tekst biti pomjeren."

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:150 TutorialMoveText.py:187
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"As explained, there are two ways to move text in a text area: using the "
"mouse and using the keyboard. Do you want to see the other way?"
msgstr ""
"Kao što je već objašnjeno, postoje dva načina da se pomjeri tekst u "
"tekstualno polje: korištenjem miša i korištenjem tastature. Želite li "
"koristiti drugi način?"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:152 TutorialMoveText.py:189
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "Yes, please"
msgstr "Da, molim"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:153 TutorialMoveText.py:199
msgctxt "@action"
msgid "No, thanks"
msgstr "Ne, hvala"

#: TutorialMoveText.cpp:159 TutorialMoveText.py:205
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "That's all.<nl/>Now you can close the tutorial."
msgstr "To je sve.<nl/>Sada možete zatvoriti lekciju."

#: TutorialMoveText.py:159
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para><emphasis>Warning:</emphasis> due to <link url=\"https://bugs.kde.org/"
"show_bug.cgi?id=219787\">Kross bug 219787</link>, this step will crash "
"KTutorial test app. Hopefully, soon the patch given in the bug will be "
"applied and there will be no more crashes ;)</para><para>If you are "
"wondering why a tutorial that crashes was included in KTutorial test app, "
"the answer is because although it crashes, it also contains examples of "
"advanced tutorial scripting using Python.</para><para>Press with the left "
"button of the mouse on the selected text. You must press on it, or the "
"selection will change, and you will have to select it again. Do not release "
"the button yet.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para><emphasis>Upozorenje:</emphasis> uslijed <link url=\"https://bugs.kde."
"org/show_bug.cgi?id=219787\">Greška 219787</link>, ovaj korak će oboriti "
"KTutorial testnu aplikaciju. Nadamo se da će zakrpa za ovu grešku brzo biti "
"primijenjena i da više neće dolaziti do ove situacije. ;)</para><para>Ako se "
"pitate zašto je lekcija koja može biti oborena uključena u KTutorial testnu "
"aplikaciju, a odgovor je da i pored tog nedostatka, ova lekcija sadrži dosta "
"korisne primjere kreiranja skripti koristeći Python.</para><para>Pritisnite "
"lijevim klikom miša odabrani tekst. Morate to uraditi, ili će se izgubiti "
"izbor teksta, i morat ćete ponovo to uraditi. Ne opuštajte dugme lijevog "
"klika još uvijek.</para>"
